      "verification": "REJECTED tombstone (merged into Mgcl2_X_6_H2o by #414): its identifier was re-pointed to CHEBI:86345 on 2026-08-20 but ontology_mapping still named CHEBI:6636 'magnesium dichloride', so the anhydrous label was still claimed by a hexahydrate record (#232). Point the mapping at the hexahydrate term and retype the anhydrous alias REJECTED_LABEL."
    }
